--Description / thinking process:  
--  • Need to see the fully‑qualified symbol that follows “import” (and optional “static”) in Java files.  
--  • Steps inside query:  
--      1) Restrict SAMPLE_CONTENTS to paths ending in .java.  
--      2) SPLIT_TO_TABLE turns file text into separate lines.  
--      3) Keep only lines that contain an import statement (ILIKE 'import %').  
--      4) REGEXP_SUBSTR with two capture groups:  
--           (static\s+)?  – optional “static ” (group 1, ignored)  
--           ([A-Za-z0-9_\.]+) – package + class symbol (group 2, returned)  
--         The 6th parameter = 2 returns group 2.  
